 "stem": "Find the general term of the sequence $\\{a_n\\}$ determined by $a_1 = {=a1}, \\ a_{n+1} = {=p}a_n + {=q}$. Write $a_n$ in terms of $n$.",
 "solution": [
  "Solve $c = {=p}c + {=q}$: $c = -{=m}$.",
  "Then $a_{n+1} + {=m} = {=p}(a_n + {=m})$, so $b_n = a_n + {=m}$ is a geometric sequence with ratio ${=p}$.",
